# A part of a cost that would make hidden information known waits for the cast's commit unless a step paid after it could
# read what it does (the owner's ruling of 2026-11-21, docs/engine-design.md "Taking back an illegal action"). Then it is
# carried out at once, and the cast is past giving up. Bolas's Citadel casts Cosmogoyf and then Fling off the top of the
# library for life equal to their mana values, and Ashiok, Wicked Manipulator exiles that many cards from the top of the
# library instead (CR 119.4, 614.1a). Cosmogoyf's power is the number of cards Bot1 owns in exile (CR 604.3), and Fling
# deals damage equal to the power of the creature sacrificed for it (CR 608.2h), so for Fling the order of the life and
# the sacrifice matters and is asked (CR 601.2h). Cosmogoyf's own cast exiles Island and Plains as it is committed. For
# Fling, Bot1 pays the life first: the exile of two more cards (Mountain, Forest) is done then, before the sacrifice
# is chosen, and from then on no cancel is offered. Cosmogoyf, sacrificed with four cards in exile, is a 4/5 as it
# goes, and Fling deals 4 to Bot2. The life stays 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Bolas's Citadel
Mox Emerald
Ashiok, Wicked Manipulator
Swamp
Cosmogoyf
Island
Plains
Fling
Mountain
Forest
Island x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bolas's Citadel.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ashiok, Wicked Manipulator.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Library.Cosmogoyf.Cast
? Exile = Island; Plains
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Cosmogoyf.Power = 2
Bot1.Library.Fling.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Pay 2 life)
? Exile.Count = 4
! Bot1.Cancel
Bot1.Choose(Cosmogoyf)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Exile.Count = 4
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Graveyard = Fling; Cosmogoyf; Black Lotus
